{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hecke范畴"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Hecke 范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"约化群","text":"约化群"}},{"Plain":" $G$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Borel子群","text":"Borel 子群"}},{"Plain":" $B$, Hecke 范畴大致是 “双商叠”\n$$\r\nB \\backslash G / B = \\mathbf{B}B\\times_{\\mathbf{B}G} \\mathbf{B}B\r\n$$\n上的层范畴\n$$\r\n\\mathcal H = \\mathsf{Sh}(B \\backslash G / B).\r\n$$\n其中 $\\mathsf{Sh}$ 是某个层理论, 例如 "},{"Local":{"url":"D-模","text":"D-模"}},{"Plain":". 因此 Hecke 范畴是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hecke代数","text":"Hecke 代数"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>更一般地 (参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"BenZviNadlerChG","text":"Ben-Zvi–Nadler"}},{"Plain":"), 对"},{"Local":{"url":"叠","text":"叠"}},{"Plain":"的映射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, 可定义 Hecke 范畴\n$$\r\n\\mathcal H = \\mathsf{Sh}(X\\times_Y X),\r\n$$\n由 $X\\times_Y X\\times_Y X$ 到 $X\\times_Y X$ 的三个投影映射的推前-拉回可定义 $\\mathcal H$ 上的一种"},{"Local":{"url":"卷积","text":"卷积"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>卷积</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"卷积","text":"卷积"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}